                <p>
                    nan<unclear>·</unclear>ti-p·-pōt·tarai
                    <lb n="2" break="no"/>yarkki yāṇt’ iru-pat·t’ ain·t-ā
                    <lb n="3" break="no"/>vatu
                </p>   
                
                <p>      			
                    <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>-Āritam<unclear>·</unclear> pullaṉ
                    <lb n="4"/>makaṉ pul<unclear>·</unclear>laya-kaṭam<unclear>·</unclear>pa
                    <lb n="5" break="no"/>ṉ· cey·vit·ta kaṟ-kumiḻi
                </p>
