            </div>
            
            
            <div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
                
                <p n="1">
                    Fortune!
                </p>
                <p n="1-3">
                    Twenty-fifth year of Nantippōttaraiyar.<note>Sanskrit Nandin + Tamil Pōttaraiyar. That is, the Pallava king Nandin.</note>
                </p>
                <p n="3-5">
                    Stone-sluice that Pullayakaṭampaṉ, son of Āritam Pullaṉ, had built.
                </p>
                
